        .. math::
            \begin{aligned}
                n_t = \tanh(W_{in} x_t + b_{in} + r_t \odot (W_{hn} h_{(t-1)}+ b_{hn}))
            \end{aligned}

        This implementation differs on purpose for efficiency.

    .. include:: ../cudnn_persistent_rnn.rst

